# Optional CoinGecko Demo API key. Without it the public keyless endpoint works
# but is heavily rate-limited (~5-15 req/min) — fine because charts are cached in
# 6h buckets, but a free demo key (https://www.coingecko.com/en/api/pricing)
# raises the ceiling a lot. Set this in your hosting env / Vercel project vars.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=
